    "rich-text-0": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_9Gqk3r": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>You're tired — but not the kind of tired that sleep fixes. Your mind running before you open your eyes. An anxiousness sitting with you that you can't quite name. And somewhere underneath it all is this quiet thought: this isn't how I'm supposed to feel.</p><p>You're not wrong.</p><p>The physicians who recommend Orenda have been with us for years. They use the products. Their families use them. That's trust earned, over time, through results that show up in real life.</p><p>When your detoxification pathways are clear, and your gut microbiome is where it should be, something shifts. Some sleep better. Some think more clearly. Some just wake up one day feeling more like themselves again.</p><p>That's what Orenda is here to support.</p><p>Twenty years. The physicians stayed. The customers came back. That tells you everything.</p><p>When you're ready, we're here.</p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        },
        "text_zek4PK": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Orenda's natural solutions work in sync with your body, starting at the cellular level. Our best sellers support cellular detoxification and a thriving gut microbiome, the two foundations that influence how you sleep, how you feel, and how much energy you bring to your day.*</p><p>And if you haven't discovered our newest addition yet, Orenda CreatinePLUS is quietly becoming one of our most talked about products, especially for women looking to support their strength, fuel sharper thinking, and sustain energy as they age.* </p><p>For over two decades, we've been dedicated to helping people rediscover their sense of vitality. Experience your very best with Orenda.</p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        },
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "If you could change one thing...",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "cd36a05b-8cc4-49d6-9133-a47505be1a86": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Discover What You've Been Missing.",
