            "text": "<p>Every Orenda product is third-party tested in ISO-certified labs for quality and purity, so you know exactly what's in the bottle, and it's exactly what we say it is. Every batch is verified to confirm key ingredient quantities match our supplement facts, and tested to ensure safety from contaminants, including mold, yeast, and bacteria.</p>"
