        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Standing in the supplement aisle — or scrolling through what feels like thousands of options online — wondering what's actually worth trusting.</p><p>That's exactly why Orenda exists.</p><p>What people notice most — better sleep, steadier energy, clearer thinking, and a gut that's finally working the way it should. All of it starting where it matters most: cellular detoxification and a healthy gut microbiome.</p><p>No overwhelm. Just what works.</p>",
